# SWYBE PROJECT RULES (Strictly Follow)

1. NEVER install new packages unless explicitly told.
2. NEVER create new files unless explicitly instructed.
3. NEVER modify or delete other files in the project.
4. When updating a file, ALWAYS use the 'write_to_file' tool to completely replace the contents of that specific file with the new code provided.
5. Do not run any terminal commands without asking me first.
6. If you encounter an error, explain it to me instead of trying 10 different fixes.